abstract: "Real arithmetic extended with a null element that is the identity of both addition and multiplication: a NumPy reference implementation, PyTorch layers that skip missing inputs and abstain when all inputs are missing, exact freezing of parameter entries, and a Verilog multiply-accumulate cell with null tags."
